    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="49">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 49</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwá hadbryce gewyrce, gebete þæt be ðæs hades mæðe, swa be were swa be wite swa be lahslite swa be ealre are.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone injures one of the clergy, he shall make amends according to the rank of the person injured, either by the payment of [his] wergeld or a fine or lahslit, or by the forfeiture of all his property.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa hadbryce gewyrce, gebete þæt be hades mæðe, swa be were swa be wite swa be lahslite swa be ealre are.</ab>
      </div>
